{
 "title": "自动清理与 defer",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "Greengold 没有垃圾回收器。当 Move 类型到达其所在作用域的末尾时，编译器会**自己**释放内存（`drop`）。你从不写 `free`，也不可能忘记。"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**`defer`** 标记离开作用域时要运行的清理代码（正常退出、`return`、`break`、`continue`、出错：都一样）。多个 `defer` 按**相反的顺序**运行（最后写的最先运行）。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"started\")",
    "    defer print(\"cleanup 1 (written first, runs last)\")",
    "    defer print(\"cleanup 2\")",
    "    defer print(\"cleanup 3 (written last, runs first)\")",
    "    print(\"working...\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "started",
    "working...",
    "cleanup 3 (written last, runs first)",
    "cleanup 2",
    "cleanup 1 (written first, runs last)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn process(code: i32):",
    "    print(\"resource opened\")",
    "    defer print(\"resource closed\")",
    "    if code < 0:",
    "        print(\"error, returning early\")",
    "        return",
    "    print(\"processed\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    process(1)",
    "    process(-1)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "resource opened",
    "processed",
    "resource closed",
    "resource opened",
    "error, returning early",
    "resource closed"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c05-l06-x1",
   "prompt": "在 `run()` 中输出 `open`、`use` 和 `close` 三条消息；但用 `defer` 写 `close`，紧跟在 `open` 之后。期望的顺序是：open、use、close。",
   "starter": [
    "fn run():",
    "    print(\"open\")",
    "    print(\"use\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    run()"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn run():",
    "    print(\"open\")",
    "    defer print(\"close\")",
    "    print(\"use\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    run()"
   ],
   "hint": "在 `print(\"open\")` 下面添加 `defer print(\"close\")`。",
   "expected": [
    "open",
    "use",
    "close"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c05-l06-q1",
   "q": "写了三个 `defer` 时，哪个最先运行？",
   "options": [
    "最先写的",
    "最后写的",
    "随机的一个"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`defer` 按相反顺序运行（LIFO）。"
  }
 ]
}
